  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the raclette-grill to medium-high heat for 10 minutes.",
    "Rinse and chop the onion, and mince the garlic.",
    "Combine soybean sprouts, kongnamul, labneh, pomegranate molasses, sumac, cumin, and black pepper in a large bowl.",
    "Add chopped onion and minced garlic to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Transfer the mixture to the raclette-grill and press down firmly to create a solid layer.",
    "Heat the remaining 1 tablespoon of olive oil in the pan.",
    "Place the pan on top of the raclette-grill to add extra flavor and texture.",
    "Grill for 15-20 minutes, or until the edges start to shatter and caramelize.",
    "Remove from heat and garnish with chopped parsley and pomegranate seeds if desired.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
